    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Display a custom message in the header with customizable options</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20i%20turn%20off%20the%20countdown%20timer%3F'>\nCan I turn off the Countdown timer?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can turn off the Countdown timer by setting the date to a future date.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20change%20the%20message%3F'>\nCan I change the message?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can change the message by editing the message in the plugin settings.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20change%20the%20message%20color%3F'>\nCan I change the message color?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can change the message color by editing the message color in the plugin settings.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20change%20the%20message%20background%20color%3F'>\nCan I change the message background color?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can change the message background color by editing the message background color in the plugin settings.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
